      "evidence_id": "official-2136f2abc8e9307ba20d36ff8b39cc5c",
      "source_url": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-announces-financial-results-for-second-quarter-fiscal-2027",
      "published_at": null,
      "available_at": "2026-08-27T04:00:00Z",
      "retrieval": {
        "document_id": "9bc4950664f1773de163da3dd9058b9373a2a553b8e772949ad5899a0c0436dc",
        "content_hash": "282f517583f249b35d4e497b64c8370439b42034e31fc0f31481753740e73c70",
        "source_query": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news?q=earnings",
        "source_type": "company_ir",
        "authority": "official",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-09-17T15:05:18.244700Z",
        "publication_date": "2026-08-26",
        "publication_precision": "date",
        "available_at": "2026-08-27T04:00:00Z",
        "content_locator": "已讀 HTML 全文後節選；字元區間：0:6000,8397:11914,18532:22039,24103:27610",
        "excerpt": "Outlook\nNVIDIA’s outlook for the third quarter of fiscal 2027 is as follows:\nRevenue is expected to be $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%. NVIDIA is not assuming any Data Center compute revenue from China in its outlook.\nGAAP and non-GAAP gross margins are expected to be 74.0%, plus or minus 50 basis points.\nGAAP and non-GAAP operating expenses are expected to be approximately $9.2 billion and $9.0 billion, respectively.",
        "claim_kind": "company_guidance",
        "source_status": "current"
      },
      "symbols": [
        "NVDA"
      ],
      "summary": "文件提供 NVIDIA 2027 財年第三季展望，包含：營收預期為 108.0 億美元（±2%）；並明確表示其指引不假設來自中國的數據中心運算收入。亦列出毛利率、營運費用等預期範圍/數字。",
      "market_relevance": "若市場關注中國數據中心需求，指引中「不假設中國 compute」的措辭可能反映管理層對區域需求/供應能見度的保守或排除假設。",
      "interpretation": "untrusted_observation"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "official-56cfdff93d88a4634c2f936d91ec000e",
      "source_url": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/monetary20260916a.htm",
      "published_at": "2026-09-16T18:00:00Z",
      "available_at": "2026-09-16T18:00:17Z",
      "retrieval": {
        "document_id": "da3bcbb85f4595d6b859363dce4a60cecd20e7593bb1a729eadc864f44b7a9f9",
        "content_hash": "24232c69fd6752469f3be65a81b75e20ce095dc05520bbe0d6f2b1e76595e689",
        "source_query": "https://www.federalreserve.gov/feeds/press_monetary.xml",
        "source_type": "macro_release",
        "authority": "official",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-09-17T15:05:22.455612Z",
        "publication_date": "2026-09-16",
        "publication_precision": "datetime",
        "available_at": "2026-09-16T18:00:17Z",
        "content_locator": "已讀 HTML 全文；換行分隔文字節點",
        "excerpt": "The Committee decided to raise the target range for the federal funds rate by 1/4 percentage point\nto 3-3/4\nto 4 percent, in support of the Federal Reserve's dual mandate. The Committee is continuing its policy of maintaining ample reserves in the banking system.",
        "claim_kind": "fact",
        "source_status": "revised"
      },
      "symbols": [
        "AVGO",
        "CASH",
        "GLD",
        "META",
        "NVDA",
        "PLTR"
      ],
      "summary": "文件為聯準會 FOMC 聲明，內容指出委員會以 12–0 投票決定將聯邦基金利率目標區間上調 1/4 個百分點至 3-3/4 到 4%。並提及將繼續維持銀行體系充裕準備金。",
      "market_relevance": "政策利率目標上調會影響無風險利率與資金成本，進而影響包括科技成長股在內的估值與風險資產定價。",
      "interpretation": "untrusted_observation"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "official-7fe08df67809ff2d20098b67182c4d07",
      "source_url": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-announces-financial-results-for-second-quarter-fiscal-2027",
      "published_at": null,
      "available_at": "2026-08-27T04:00:00Z",
      "retrieval": {
        "document_id": "9bc4950664f1773de163da3dd9058b9373a2a553b8e772949ad5899a0c0436dc",
        "content_hash": "282f517583f249b35d4e497b64c8370439b42034e31fc0f31481753740e73c70",
        "source_query": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news?q=earnings",
        "source_type": "company_ir",
        "authority": "official",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-09-17T15:05:18.244700Z",
        "publication_date": "2026-08-26",
        "publication_precision": "date",
        "available_at": "2026-08-27T04:00:00Z",
        "content_locator": "已讀 HTML 全文後節選；字元區間：0:6000,8397:11914,18532:22039,24103:27610",
        "excerpt": "Revenue of $96.2 billion, up 106% from a year ago\nData Center revenue of $89.0 billion, up 117% from a year ago\nAugust 26, 2026\nNVIDIA (NASDAQ: NVDA) today reported revenue for the second quarter ended July 26, 2026, of $96.2 billion, up 18% from the previous quarter and up 106% from a year ago. For the quarter, GAAP and non-GAAP gross margins were both 75.0%. GAAP and non-GAAP earnings per diluted share were $2.46 and $2.22, respectively.",
        "claim_kind": "fact",
        "source_status": "current"
      },
      "symbols": [
        "NVDA"
      ],
      "summary": "文件指出，NVIDIA（第二季截至 2026-07-26）營收為 960.2 億美元，年增；同時 GAAP 與非 GAAP 毛利率均為 75.0%。並列出相應的 GAAP 與非 GAAP 稀釋每股盈餘數字。",
      "market_relevance": "營收規模與毛利率屬於公司獲利能力的直接財務訊號，可能影響市場對其 AI 基礎設施需求強度與成本結構的評估。",
      "interpretation": "untrusted_observation"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "official-9e43f3d3a8fdf5fac3137644e89026dc",
      "source_url": "https://www.bea.gov/news/2026/personal-income-and-outlays-july-2026",
      "published_at": null,
      "available_at": "2026-09-17T12:00:55Z",
      "retrieval": {
        "document_id": "5895968b941e893ae940f010268634dd017bbc4c4058557676a7d36a9b08e05d",
        "content_hash": "3a27064e283dfb1a113322b50c4a8c3633faf7f346116dfbfcc19467fbcc4059",
        "source_query": "https://www.bea.gov/news/current-releases",
        "source_type": "macro_release",
        "authority": "official",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-09-17T15:05:23.610963Z",
        "publication_date": "2026-08-26",
        "publication_precision": "date",
        "available_at": "2026-09-17T12:00:55Z",
        "content_locator": "已讀 HTML 全文；換行分隔文字節點",
        "excerpt": "Personal income\nincreased $115.1 billion\n(0.4 percent at a monthly rate) in July, according to estimates released today by the U.S. Bureau of Economic Analysis (BEA).\nDisposable personal income (DPI)\n—personal income less personal current taxes—increased $125.9 billion (0.5 percent), and\npersonal consumption expenditures (PCE)\nincreased $36.3 billion (0.2 percent).\nPersonal outlays\n—the sum of PCE, personal interest payments, and personal current transfer payments—increased $36.6 billion in July.\nPersonal saving\nwas $712.0 billion in July, and the\npersonal saving rate\n—personal saving as a percentage of DPI—was 3.0 percent.",
        "claim_kind": "fact",
        "source_status": "revised"
      },
      "symbols": [
        "AVGO",
        "CASH",
        "GLD",
        "META",
        "NVDA",
        "PLTR"
      ],
      "summary": "文件指出 BEA 估計 2026 年 7 月個人收入增加 1151 億美元（按月增率 0.4%）；並同時提供可支配個人收入、個人消費支出（PCE）與個人儲蓄/儲蓄率等數字。",
      "market_relevance": "個人收入與消費支出變化是衡量需求韌性的宏觀指標，可能影響市場對整體經濟成長與風險偏好（含消費與投資）之判斷。",
      "interpretation": "untrusted_observation"
    },
